            <div xml:id="m-9dbc2e88-907a-4b7e-ba4b-86411a0c2873">
              <lg xml:id="m-3185bd22-1a8c-41a8-904e-94ca3e07b43c">
                <l xml:id="m-001dac64-62dd-4f83-90ac-17b676d6a8e2" facs="#m-dd655d78-ffc1-4ea6-80c8-d7f4cac0461e" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of the Ascension.</l><l xml:id="m-51b29171-3369-4504-a8d2-0f4ca7de53c0" facs="#m-9446fcc5-937f-4bc8-800a-cd66ba5f919d" label="ambiguous">854</l><l xml:id="m-98be3d6b-468e-4c77-930c-5e3df0c5c1fd" facs="#m-c43155f1-edfa-43cc-bd63-345068f62c53" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus in caélo, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-05f4150e-42c7-4f41-b4bd-efe8c477a98d" facs="#m-55e4a1d7-78ba-4063-9582-1791515c5f72" label="lyrics-like">R. Parávit sédem súam, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-63475d57-d0b0-465b-bff9-62af44e5a336" facs="#m-f2af5e5e-b9a4-40f7-a2ec-e19e2b354332" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-9a84f18f-ebf8-4bec-a321-a72b8aabd9ad" facs="#m-a6e32aef-72b4-4277-9bad-96cbd6e2e31c" label="ambiguous">Ant. S.G</l><l xml:id="m-5a701db6-5c58-4cab-acc4-a6efc85a2c41" facs="#m-0fecbdab-88f7-42cb-acd7-0e89435ad8c8" label="lyrics-like">UM vé-ne-rit “Parácli-tus, quem égo míttam vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2639613-3590-42f6-8bdd-224d272d2015" facs="#m-d61fd047-fc56-44e1-b367-f08c6e9c57a0" label="lyrics-like">bis, Spí-ri-tum ve-ri-tá- tis, qui a Pâtre procédit, ille</l><l xml:id="m-a2446974-c694-4d84-baad-182a2a05a4e4" facs="#m-d0e89ca7-7e4b-4b4b-bc25-ebca6bf1d501" label="lyrics-like">testimó-ni- um perhibébit de me, alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-a445f6aa-f498-417f-bd9d-000bbe44ba4a" facs="#m-c205d836-a523-4796-9cfd-90ca82dbb26c" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212. — Prayer. Omnípotens. p. 855.</l><l xml:id="m-aaa58ffb-7852-4367-a72b-fa3972bea7d3" facs="#m-35bb66f0-0872-4dc7-9beb-02e0763fcced" label="text-like">A commemoration is made of the Octave of the Ascension. Ant. O Rez</l><l xml:id="m-6793bdb6-faa6-48dd-9de0-1935767b7b7a" facs="#m-9455aa6b-63d4-42ab-89ec-cf81f4d88cbc" label="lyrics-like">glóriae. p. 853.</l><l xml:id="m-059492f2-22e0-4ecf-9efa-4de11f7601f3" facs="#m-5a1fba6e-3c74-4480-a669-f47c7901b073" label="lyrics-like">V. Ascéndit Déus in jubilatióne, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-83e6b2f7-345a-42eb-be8d-4b9c79d8e4f3" facs="#m-0e209cbb-e7c0-4496-9f36-6fd9e137dbdf" label="lyrics-like">R. Et Dóminus in vóce túbae, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-c67eacb2-e08d-439e-b879-6dd142139cc0" facs="#m-6d0548c7-a646-4238-8f92-846392c86eac" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Concéde, quaésumus. p. 853.</l><l xml:id="m-4e27d858-90ad-431e-8a56-d1172aaf2c40" facs="#m-d824388d-3f17-4a4e-a572-dbf2867a1a85" label="text-like">Compline of the Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-6b94cbd0-77ca-422d-a227-3ff26a4a50f0" facs="#m-4cc7d174-cd9d-4698-8087-117f0987dd61" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Viri Galilaéi. D. 850. Psalms of Feasts. p. 226. Short</l><l xml:id="m-9fb5bad4-9783-472b-865e-460c5c0aa17a" facs="#m-cdcd40fa-05df-4372-aac9-46baf2f75c66" label="lyrics-like">Lesson. Si quis lóquitur. p. 857.</l><l xml:id="m-15db360c-4035-4365-9346-8e1140528227" facs="#m-aac769c0-0989-4b9d-880b-d5ae10add7b3" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-388757a7-fff2-4cd1-8dfd-9ee5b95b6e65" facs="#m-ca6ed33f-a004-4dad-b782-c82b2b11e9cf" label="ambiguous">Hymn, p. 846. Ant. Cumque. p. 851.</l><l xml:id="m-519d761c-6a87-4f5c-9f45-536f61b5a00e" facs="#m-ff6a9a8d-c9c3-4de7-b20c-afa41c335b0b" label="lyrics-like">Chapter of Vespers. Carissimi: Estóte. D. 857. Short Resp. Ascéndit</l><l xml:id="m-46aa5d53-759d-4fd5-9a1a-95754ea0acd3" facs="#m-60d59cdf-593f-451b-b357-5550711113be" label="ambiguous">Deus. p. 846.</l><l xml:id="m-ebd4c509-7588-45b0-971b-fa6ca0a63ea4" facs="#m-7d79519a-eb81-47ba-b502-dd39b7e76b22" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-9e143787-df43-4865-a37f-54a75390250a" facs="#m-346d5eb7-1718-4208-9166-73e1eedc6195" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-52d892fb-471e-400b-a0fe-de468f0a695a" facs="#m-dcf6a2b1-2943-4217-8bd6-a612052596db" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-62122be6-6918-46e3-8045-02ae892f9bbe" facs="#m-029f7eec-1c9c-4301-be77-b0dc46f1a4b4" label="ambiguous">71</l><l xml:id="m-a934dd5a-c4da-43aa-b4f3-df85c2338e14" facs="#m-829da728-9169-4907-8131-993b7a9959a8" label="lyrics-like">X-áudi, " Dó-mine, vócem mé¬ am, qua clamá¬</l><l xml:id="m-21bee5d9-b2b7-48d6-b504-519e72818654" facs="#m-14691e71-0cc1-4e65-9260-6206e6e16e98" label="lyrics-like">vi ad te, alle- lú- ia: tí-bi díxit cor mé¬ um, quaesí¬</l><l xml:id="m-230bb2e8-7b67-4ba4-88a4-0beb5f813c40" facs="#m-c570dd1d-cf95-4f08-be40-41d2aed09fbd" label="lyrics-like">vi vúltum tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-01093b1d-3893-4081-a51d-146f86c3f04e" facs="#m-fff48c38-1893-4100-ad00-cd9e251e9868" label="lyrics-like">um, vúltum tú-um Dómine requí-ram:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
